{"4435710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pass the Bomb : Runner", "steam_appid": 4435710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Check out the update details and tips in the YouTube video.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the Bomb : Runner is a hardcore balance action game where you adjust your arm angle and the bomb’s height to maintain its center of gravity, avoid a variety of obstacles, and push forward endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/660b025dbc5c30a952115adf375784e5.webp?t=1785936756\" width=606 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A key / ← arrow key: Raise arm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D key / → arrow keys: Lower arm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse Click: Catch the Bomb</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short presses of the key will cause weak arm movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you hold, the more acceleration you will get, making your arm go up or down faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you drop the bomb, you can click it to catch it again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> [Arm strength system]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you move your arm, the weaker it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, your arm lowers automatically at an increasing speed, making it harder to maintain balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach a save statue, your arm strength is restored.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a6e75f67f20098e9855d62966f6c25c3.poster.avif?t=1785936756\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a6e75f67f20098e9855d62966f6c25c3.webm?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a6e75f67f20098e9855d62966f6c25c3.mp4?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Speed ​​change according to center of gravity]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's movement speed changes depending on the location of the bomb.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you raise the bomb → the speed will slow down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you drop the bomb → the speed increases</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/d52c75b39613803ed426ea3a73f5e74c.poster.avif?t=1785936756\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/d52c75b39613803ed426ea3a73f5e74c.webm?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/d52c75b39613803ed426ea3a73f5e74c.mp4?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> [Burning wick]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all the wicks on the rim burn out, the bomb explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach a save statue, the burned wick will be restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can't stop until you reach a save statue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a13a1c06c8b4e8f5c8d42f13cd788eed.poster.avif?t=1785936756\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a13a1c06c8b4e8f5c8d42f13cd788eed.webm?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a13a1c06c8b4e8f5c8d42f13cd788eed.mp4?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Avoiding risks and obstacles]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must control your speed and adjust the height of the bomb to avoid various obstacles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles explode when they touch the player or bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a bomb falls under your feet or passes over your head, it will explode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A moment's mistake can lead to an explosion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a6e014c2efec1b1bf29ffa4c2c79125d.poster.avif?t=1785936756\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a6e014c2efec1b1bf29ffa4c2c79125d.webm?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a6e014c2efec1b1bf29ffa4c2c79125d.mp4?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Catch the Bomb]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you drop the bomb, you can click it with your mouse to catch it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bomb becomes catchable as soon as the “Catch the Bomb” UI appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you catch it before it explodes, you can resume from the exact spot where you dropped it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/76d6cf303b770219046112d58f891b3d.poster.avif?t=1785936756\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/76d6cf303b770219046112d58f891b3d.webm?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/76d6cf303b770219046112d58f891b3d.mp4?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Difficulty Selection]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy / Medium / Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>Easy</strong>, <strong>Medium</strong>, or <strong>Hard</strong> difficulty levels. Each difficulty adjusts various gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > elements—such as the timing window for catching bombs, the rate at which arm strength decreases, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the timing required to counteract the wind—providing a distinct gameplay experience and overall challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to the end with your quick reflexes and focus amidst various hazards and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the end of the journey, hand over the bomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five stages await you.    <br>Explore a variety of environments including <strong>Plains, Forest, Cave, Snowfield, and Dungeon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features its own <strong>unique background music</strong>,    <br>enhancing immersion alongside a variety of <strong>sound effects</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> No checkpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Check out the update details and tips in the YouTube video.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the Bomb : Runner is a hardcore balance action game where you adjust your arm angle and the bomb’s height to maintain its center of gravity, avoid a variety of obstacles, and push forward endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/660b025dbc5c30a952115adf375784e5.webp?t=1785936756\" width=606 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A key / ← arrow key: Raise arm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D key / → arrow keys: Lower arm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse Click: Catch the Bomb</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short presses of the key will cause weak arm movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you hold, the more acceleration you will get, making your arm go up or down faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you drop the bomb, you can click it to catch it again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> [Arm strength system]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you move your arm, the weaker it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, y