ts/steam/apps/4435710/extras/a6e014c2efec1b1bf29ffa4c2c79125d.mp4?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Catch the Bomb]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you drop the bomb, you can click it with your mouse to catch it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bomb becomes catchable as soon as the “Catch the Bomb” UI appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you catch it before it explodes, you can resume from the exact spot where you dropped it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/76d6cf303b770219046112d58f891b3d.poster.avif?t=1785936756\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/76d6cf303b770219046112d58f891b3d.webm?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435710/extras/76d6cf303b770219046112d58f891b3d.mp4?t=1785936756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Difficulty Selection]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy / Medium / Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>Easy</strong>, <strong>Medium</strong>, or <strong>Hard</strong> difficulty levels. Each difficulty adjusts various gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > elements—such as the timing window for catching bombs, the rate at which arm strength decreases, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the timing required to counteract the wind—providing a distinct gameplay experience and overall challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to the end with your quick reflexes and focus amidst various hazards and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the end of the journey, hand over the bomb.</p><p